stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Loading
    Loading --> Ready: Read saved palette or Nocturne defaults
    Ready --> Resolving: Select scheme + flavour + optional mode
    Resolving --> Ready: Reject invalid selection / show error
    Resolving --> Generating: Resolve supported appearance
    Generating --> Ready: Wallpaper missing / show error, retain saved palette
    Generating --> Saving: Complete palette
    Saving --> Ready: Write fails / retain saved palette
    Saving --> Applying: Atomic replace of scheme.json
    Applying --> Ready: File watcher updates palette bindings
    Applying --> Ready: Refresh catalog and available appearances
    Applying --> WritingHyprland: Hyprland integration enabled
    WritingHyprland --> IntegrationFailed: Write fails / retain old compositor palette
    WritingHyprland --> Offline: Atomic replace of current.conf / no active compositor
    WritingHyprland --> Reloading: Atomic replace of current.conf / snapshot disabled outputs
    Offline --> CompositorApplied: Next startup imports Burl theme
    Reloading --> CompositorApplied: Lua config imports Burl theme / restore disabled outputs
    Reloading --> IntegrationFailed: Missing hyprctl, timeout or reload failure
    IntegrationFailed --> WritingHyprland: Retry applying scheme
    CompositorApplied --> Ready
    note right of Resolving
        One candidate, one write.
        No intermediate scheme or flavour is saved.
    end note
    note right of Ready
        Panels and controls bind to palette roles.
        Painted artwork retains its source colours.
    end note
